 "summary": "The new results (local strictly convex isometry lemma, Lipschitz bound for the logarithm, Myers\u2013Steenrod smoothness, and the IsometryEquiv to RiemannianIsometry conversion) have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or TauCeti, and they reuse Mathlib's `Isometry.affineIsometryOfStrictConvexSpace`, TauCeti's `enorm_sub_le_mul_pathELength`, and the existing radial-geodesic lemmas instead of reproving them. `edist_le_mul_riemannianEDist` needs a map that is C\u00b9 everywhere, so it cannot replace the logarithm bound, which holds only on the normal ball.",
